# Moxa ioLogik R1212.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Moxa ioLogik R1212 Remote RTU I/O — 16-channel DI + 8-channel DIO
# | 
# | Source: ioLogik R1200 Series User Manual V3.2, November 2017 (Appendix)
# | Protocol: Modbus RTU (RS-485); 9600 8N1 default, address configurable via software
# | 
# | DI channels (ch0-15): same as R1210
# | FC03 addr 0-15: DI_Mode; addr 32-47: DI_filterValue; addr 64-79: DI_counterTriggerType
# | FC04 addr 0-15: DI value word; addr 32,34,...62: DI counter value u32 step-2 pairs
# | FC02 addr 0-15: DI bit value; FC01 addr 0-175: counter control (same as R1210)
# | DIO channels (ch0-7, configurable as DI or DO):
# | FC02 addr 0x0120-0x0127 (288-295): DIO Direction (0=DI, 1=DO)
# | FC04 addr 0x0120-0x0127 (288-295): DIO Direction word
# | DO channels (ch0-7, when DIO set to DO):
# | FC03 addr 0x0140-0x0147 (320-327): DO value ch0-7
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Moxa
@model=ioLogik R1212
@description=16-DI + 8-DIO remote RTU I/O, Modbus RTU RS-485 9600 8N1. FC03 DI: DI_Mode ch0-15 (0-15), DI_filterValue ch0-15 (32-47), DI_counterTriggerType ch0-15 (64-79). FC03 DO: DO_value ch0-7 (320-327), DO_pulseOutCount u32 ch0-7 (352,353,354,355,...366,367 step-2 pairs), DO_pulseWidthON ch0-7 (416-423), DO_pulseWidthOFF ch0-7 (448-455), DO_saveModeStatus ch0-7 (480-487, 0=OFF 1=ON 3=hold), DO_mode ch0-7 (512-519, 0=DO 1=Pulse). FC04: DI_value (0-15), DI_counterValue u32 step-2 (32-62), DIO_direction (288-295). FC02: DI_bitValue (0-15), DIO_direction (288-295). FC01: DI counter ctrl (0-175), DO ctrl (320+).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/moxa-iologik-r1212.toml; Source: ioLogik R1200 Series User Manual V3.2, November 2017 (Appendix). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

